# Templ generated code (internal/web/views/*_templ.go) is COMMITTED so a clean
# checkout builds with plain `go build` — no CLI, no network, no build chain.
# After editing a .templ file run `make generate` and commit the result; CI
# and the release workflow fail if the two disagree.
